/*---
desc: It is a Syntax Error if the binding pattern of the rest parameter contains duplicate elements.
template: syntax
negative:
  phase: parse
  type: SyntaxError
info: |
  Static Semantics: Early Errors

  FormalParameters :
    FunctionRestParameter
    FormalParameterList ,opt
    FormalParameterList , FunctionRestParameter

  - It is a Syntax Error if the BoundNames of FormalParameters contains any
    duplicate elements and either IsSimpleParameterList of FormalParameters is
    false or IsStrict(FormalParameters) is true.
features: [rest-parameters, destructuring-binding]
---*/

//- setup
$DONOTEVALUATE();
//- params
...[x, x]
